Who will it be?!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.320
Wow! <i>Wow!</i>

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.240
Not a chance! No way I'm losing!

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:42.830
It's the first time I've seen someone crossing the finish line like that.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:50.840
We're going to clean the leaves on the ground after school.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.920
We are doing it together with the Cleaning Committee.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.760
Cleaning it all would be a little too hard.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.300
What are you saying?

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:04.600
Our motto is voluntarily doing the things others wouldn't do.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:05.900
That's right.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.400
Voluntarily doing it from where others wouldn't want.

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:11.990
How can you get it so wrong?

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.830
It just doesn't end.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:23.790
Looks like you're in need of some help, Tsuda.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.040
Guess I'll just have to give you a <i>leaft</i>.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:31.590
Once we're done with the cleaning,
we'll have a roasted sweet potatoes party!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.210
Shino's Broom

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.170
Huh?

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.140
Don't give me that!

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:40.680
You'll make me look like I really want those potatoes!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:45.440
Someone forgot something?

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:47.690
It has a name on it.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:52.280
Giving names to inanimate objects...

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.490
What a weird fetish.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:58.200
Can't you think it's the name of the owner?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.590
There's still one left, you want it?

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.050
No, I don't think I could...

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:15.590
...fit it anymore.

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:16.840
Not even in there.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.590
Just where is "there"?

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:30.730
Hey, Toki! I know it's cold,

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:33.070
but you must wear the uniform properly!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:38.110
Please wait! Toki isn't doing it because she wants to!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:42.780
She stained her panties earlier when she sat on someone's half-eaten curry bread.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.990
I told you to keep your mouth shut!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.620
So you're a klutz?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.160
Seitokai Yakuindomo

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.880
very hard
It's snowing

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:51.920
Waking up early to this intense snow is so painful!
very hard
It's snowing

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:56.130
Waking up early to this intense snow is so painful!

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.880
We can't do anything about this weather.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.300
The public transport is stopped,

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:03.220
so we woke up earlier to avoid being late.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.810
I guess we don't have an excuse to be late.

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.640
Hey!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.060
There won't be classes today,

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.770
so you can go home.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:14.650
What?!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:19.650
Apparently an announcement was made on TV.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:22.700
I didn't know because I left earlier.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.990
What are we going to do now?

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:28.540
It would be tiresome to go back right away,

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.040
so I'm going to eat lunch first.

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:34.800
I have cold blood, so it was really tough for me.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.250
Here.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.300
It's freezing!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.880
My feet are also cold!

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:42.550
I'd rather not have to feel that.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.810
I'm joining in too.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:53.230
Ramen, fried rice and potstickers.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.730
You eat a lot, Sensei.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.820
Well I was very hungry.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.490
I was given three pair of chopsticks.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:02.660
Did they think it was for three people?

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.700
Isn't it a waste?

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:08.330
All right, let's play Kings Game after we finish eating!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.710
Could you please explain the rules <i>clearly </i>?

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:12.320
Oh come on!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.580
It's okay to strengthen our friendship every now and then.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:18.210
Well, I guess there's nothing better to do.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:21.840
However,
you may not give perverted orders.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:28.600
Is it okay if I ask you to let me hear you pee?

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:34.810
Not allowed.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:37.730
I wish you didn't have to think so much about it.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:40.440
Who's gonna be the King?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:43.990
Oh, great! I'm the King!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.910
I'm the Queen!

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:49.200
No. 2 is gonna tell us about a failed relationship.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:50.750
That's me.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.210
Well…

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.750
I've never had a failed relationship...

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.750
I've never been in one either,
to be more specific.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.510
Who's gonna be the King?

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.760
Oh, I'm the King.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.510
Stare

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.390
Well, this…

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:12.020
What are you flustering about?

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:14.940
You are our master now.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.900
Order us.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:20.320
I will do anything you ask me!

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.950
Hey, it stopped snowing.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.910
It's about time we get going.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.540
That was so much fun!

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:37.040
It's like I was a little teenage girl again!

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.420
Oh my...

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.210
Sensei, you're too excited.

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:43.420
Everyone is looking oddly at us.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:45.470
Ah, it was motherly love!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:48.140
Let me scold you first.

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:32.030
Guardian?

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:32.820
Yes.

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:37.160
Well, it has to be someone from the same family...

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:38.870
And your parents?

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:40.710
The same as always.

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:42.250
And your sister?

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:44.920
I'd have to sit in for her conference instead.

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:48.920
Oh well.

00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:50.720
Here.

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:53.640
Those kinds of things can't be decided just like that!

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:56.060
Well, whatever.

00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:58.720
Well, now that you have accepted...

00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:00.770
Taka-kun, do you have the seal?

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:01.690
Over here.

00:24:01.690 --> 00:24:02.560
No way.

00:24:02.560 --> 00:24:04.440
That's not what I meant.

00:24:04.860 --> 00:24:06.070
Well…

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:08.340
Let's talk about your grades first.

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:12.700
You haven't raised the grades of the subjects you're doing bad at.

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:16.160
But your efforts are fine,

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:18.200
and you're doing a good job as the Vice President.

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:20.620
Everyone is confident in you.

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:26.710
I already knew you were a good boy, Taka-kun.

00:24:27.040 --> 00:24:33.380
I left my panties in plain sight and you didn't even touch them.

00:24:33.380 --> 00:24:35.470
Stop setting traps!
